# Everyone's Grudge (outlands 134), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted, EveryonesGrudgeStarted 1, three
# Gold Beastcoins and Quest[5][134]Prog 1 (GMs). Magephaud: the coins, 118; finished: the raw player:completeQuest, the
# trade taken, Norg fame +20, the Tonberry Priest Key, EveryonesGrudgeStarted 0, the title. The raw completeQuest does
# no cleanup: Quest[5][134]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Norg pos=13,0,7 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.EveryonesGrudge accepted
charvar EveryonesGrudgeStarted 1
item GoldBeastcoin x3
charvar Quest[5][134]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trade Magephaud GoldBeastcoin x3        # 118
finish                                  # completed, Prog kept; taken; fame +20; the key; Started 0; the title
trigger Magephaud                       # default turn: 115
finish
trigger Magephaud                       # script, completed: 119
finish
